      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Destructive Vengeance",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger An enemy in the champion's aura damages the champion\n\n---\nEffect The champion increases the amount of damage they take by 2d6 and deals 2d6 spirit damage to the triggering enemy. In addition, until the end of the champion's next turn, the champion's Strikes against the triggering creature deals 2 extra spirit damage.",
